WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200 line:-2
<v Sen. Cory Booker>Booker, on Strom Thurmond: To hate him was wrong.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.300 line:-2
<v Sen. Cory Booker>And maybe my ego got too caught up that if I stood here, maybe, maybe,

3
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:09.400 line:-2
<v Sen. Cory Booker>just maybe I could break this record of the man

4
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.200 line:-2
<v Sen. Cory Booker>who tried to stop the rights upon which I stand.

5
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.500 line:-2
<v Sen. Cory Booker>I’m not here, though, because of his speech.

6
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.300 line:-2
<v Sen. Cory Booker>I’m here despite his speech.

7
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.300 line:-2
<v Sen. Cory Booker>I’m here because as powerful as he was, the people were more powerful.

8
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.000 line:-2
<v Sen. Chuck Schumer>Schumer: Do you know you have just broken the record?

9
00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:29.000 line:-2
<v Sen. Chuck Schumer>Do you know how proud this caucus is of you?

10
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:31.800 line:-2
<v Sen. Chuck Schumer>Do you know how proud America is of you?

11
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:43.300 line:-2
[Applause]
